{{wikipedia}}

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{bor|en|ar|شَهَادَة||witnessing}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|en|en-us-shahada.ogg|Audio (US)}}
* {{hyphenation|en|sha|ha|da}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|-|s|shahadat}}

# {{lb|en|Islam|especially|theosophy}} The [[Islamic]] [[declaration]] of [[belief]] in the unity of God, one of the [[five pillars]], the formal content of which is the [[kalima]] (a [[minimal]] Islamic [[creed]]).

